# _headers — the response headers Cloudflare Pages adds to every file under site/public/.
# In:  every request for the landing page and its files.
# Out: a strict content policy — its own script, style and still; the planet framed and asked for its numbers; nothing else — no referrer leaks, no framing of the hub.
# Decision: start locked down and open exactly what each phase needs (W1); W3 opened four doors: script-src and img-src 'self', and the planet's address for frame-src and connect-src.
# Built in W1 — Ground (24 Sep 2026); opened for the landing page in W3 (24 Sep 2026).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://planet.anjaneyaworkshop.co.uk; frame-src https://planet.anjaneyaworkshop.co.uk; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
